    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sisyphi is a casual strategy game about two players (Sisyphus) competing against each other to push their boulder towards the finish line. But there is a twist. The map that you play on is generated from text-to-AI, so you play what you type! With short 15-minute matches, have a fun time with your friends trying to race to the finish. Use skill moves to get a better chance to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Dev Note</u></strong>: This was a solo project, and offers gameplay the scope of which is restricted by the capabilities of AI. Hence, it's not as expansive as it can be, so go easy on me!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sisyphi is a casual strategy game about two players (Sisyphus) competing against each other to push their boulder towards the finish line. But there is a twist. The map that you play on is generated from text-to-AI, so you play what you type! With short 15-minute matches, have a fun time with your friends trying to race to the finish. Use skill moves to get a better chance to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Dev Note</u></strong>: This was a solo project, and offers gameplay the scope of which is restricted by the capabilities of AI. Hence, it's not as expansive as it can be, so go easy on me!</p>",
